2. For each object, compute bounding box (min_row, max_row, min_col, max_col). Compute height = max_row-min_row+1, width = max_col-min_col+1.
3. Determine tile_size as the most common height among objects where height == width and height >= 3? In examples, tile_size is 3 or 5.
