Example 3: Centers at (5,6) and (8,1). Check (5,6): neighbors (4,6),(6,6),(5,5),(5,7) all 4? In input, (4,6)=4, (6,6)=4, (5,5)=4, (5,7)=4. Yes. (8,1): neighbors (7,1)=4, (9,1)=4, (8,0)=4, (8,2)=4. Yes. So both detected.

